                'RESEARCH Website Funding Opportunities External Research Grants Ongoing Research Projects COMPLIMENTS '
                '/ COMPLAINTS CONTACT US Search term Search Kisii University: Web People Search Web Other ways to '
                'search: Map Profiles Ms.Marriane Kemunto Ag. ICT Manager Biography Marriane Kemunto is an '
                'accomplished ICT officer with over 15 years of experience in information systems management, '
                'cybersecurity, ICT governance, and digital transformation in higher education. She currently serves '
                'as the Acting ICT Manager and Data Protection Officer at Kisii University, where she leads strategic '
                'ICT planning, information security, technology governance, and digital innovation initiatives. She '
                'holds a Master of Science in Information Systems from the University of Nairobi, a Bachelor of '
                'Science in Electronics and Computer Engineering from Jomo Kenyatta University of Agriculture and '
                'Technology, and is currently pursuing a PhD in IT Security and Audit at Jaramogi Oginga Odinga '
                'University of Science and Technology. Her professional interests include cybersecurity, ICT risk '
                'management, enterprise systems, and leveraging technology to enhance organizational performance and '
                'service delivery. Research Interests Vehicular adhoc networks Education Background Jomo Kenyatta '
                'University of Agriculture and Technology 2003 Feb - 2008 Bachelors University of Nairobi 2012 Sep - '
                '2014 Dec Masters Security in health workforce information systems: a case of regulatory human '
                'resource information system Work Experience Kisii University Feb 2018 - 2019 Kisii University 2019 - '
                '2024 Publications No publications available. Research Grants No research grants. Skills system design '
